 ChatGPT Health 服务。OpenAI 回应称 ChatGPT 不是医生，不应替代专业医疗护理。","reportEdition":"2026-07-24","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrxnw4rw00qzroxpll5shp7a","title":"Google Gemini 月活用户逼近 9.5 亿，有望成为下一个十亿级产品","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-07-24T00:00:05.649Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmrxnw4rw00qzroxpll5shp7a","https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/23/google-closes-in-on-another-billion-user-product-with-gemini"],"articles":[{"id":"cmrxnw4rw00qzroxpll5shp7a","title":"Google Gemini 月活用户逼近 9.5 亿，有望成为下一个十亿级产品","originalTitle":"","summary":"Google 在 Q2 2026 财报电话会上宣布，AI 助手 Gemini 月活跃用户已超过 9.5 亿，用户数较去年增长三倍。Gemini 正与月活突破 10 亿的 ChatGPT 展开更直接竞争，其 AI 搜索模式用户也已超过 10 亿。Sensor Tower 报告显示，Gemini 在 AI 助手市场份额升至 27.7%，而 ChatGPT 份额首次跌破 50%。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrxnw4rw00qzroxpll5shp7a","originalUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/23/google-closes-in-on-another-billion-user-product-with-gemini","publishedAt":"2026-07-24T00:00:05.649Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-156bpf7","originalSourceName":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","family":"outlet-7g1qnb","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrxnw4rw00qzroxpll5shp7a","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T10:49:12.006Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-156bpf7","name":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T10:49:12.006Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"Google 在 Q2 2026 财报电话会上宣布，AI 助手 Gemini 月活跃用户已超过 9.5 亿，用户数较去年增长三倍。Gemini 正与月活突破 10 亿的 ChatGPT 展开更直接竞争，其 AI 搜索模式用户也已超过 10 亿。Sensor Tower 报告显示，Gemini 在 AI 助手市场份额升至 27.7%，而 ChatGPT 份额首次跌破 50%。","reportEdition":"2026-07-24","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrxs4yyw01xkroxpom7zfjvc","title":"OpenAI Workspace Agents 漏洞：一个 ChatGPT 链接即可创建恶意 AI 智能体","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-07-24T00:00:05.649Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmrxs4yyw01xkroxpom7zfjvc","https://the-decoder.com/one-tampered-chatgpt-link-could-spawn-a-rogue-ai-agent-that-took-orders-from-an-attacker-every-five-minutes"],"articles":[{"id":"cmrxs4yyw01xkroxpom7zfjvc","title":"OpenAI Workspace Agents 漏洞：一个 ChatGPT 链接即可创建恶意 AI 智能体","originalTitle":"","summary":"安全公司 Zenity Labs 发现 OpenAI Workspace Agents 存在“AgentForger”漏洞，攻击者发送一个含恶意提示词的 ChatGPT 链接，即可在受害者账户下创建自主 AI 智能体。该智能体继承受害者身份和已授权应用权限，绕过安全审批，并设置每五分钟运行一次的定时任务，从攻击者邮箱获取指令执行。OpenAI 在四天内修复了该漏洞。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrxs4yyw01xkroxpom7zfjvc","originalUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/one-tampered-chatgpt-link-could-spawn-a-rogue-ai-agent-that-took-orders-from-an-attacker-every-five-minutes","publishedAt":"2026-07-24T00:00:05.649Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1uslcxv","originalSourceName":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","family":"outlet-ezirzi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrxs4yyw01xkroxpom7zfjvc","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T10:49:12.006Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1uslcxv","name":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T10:49:12.006Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"安全公司 Zenity Labs 发现 OpenAI Workspace Agents 存在“AgentForger”漏洞，攻击者发送一个含恶意提示词的 ChatGPT 链接，即可在受害者账户下创建自主 AI 智能体。该智能体继承受害者身份和已授权应用权限，绕过安全审批，并设置每五分钟运行一次的定时任务，从攻击者邮箱获取指令执行。OpenAI 在四天内修复了该漏洞。","reportEdition":"2026-07-24","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrwztuqg0000roqpmbblplr7","title":"小红书HELMSMAN：全闪存服务器实现高性能向量检索，硬件成本节省超90%","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-07-24T00:00:05.649Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmrwztuqg0000roqpmbblplr7","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WCYE6itbTBPU0Q_3BfQxkA"],"articles":[{"id":"cmrwztuqg0000roqpmbblplr7","title":"小红书HELMSMAN：全闪存服务器实现高性能向量检索，硬件成本节省超90%","originalTitle":"","summary":"小红书引擎架构团队在OSDI 2026提出HELMSMAN，一个面向全闪存服务器的高性能向量近似最近邻搜索系统。该系统通过聚类式索引、定制化存储栈和分层学习式搜索剪枝，用约40台全闪存服务器承载了过去约35,000 CPU Core和约350 TB DRAM的负载，硬件成本节省超过90%。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrwztuqg0000roqpmbblplr7","originalUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WCYE6itbTBPU0Q_3BfQxkA","publishedAt":"2026-07-24T00:00:05.649Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-5dph0r","originalSourceName":"公众号：小红书技术（dots.llm）","family":"outlet-1f9uzuv","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrwztuqg0000roqpmbblplr7","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T10:49:12.006Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-5dph0r","name":"公众号：小红书技术（dots.llm）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T10:49:12.006Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"小红书引擎架构团队在OSDI 2026提出HELMSMAN，一个面向全闪存服务器的高性能向量近似最近邻搜索系统。该系统通过聚类式索引、定制化存储栈和分层学习式搜索剪枝，用约40台全闪存服务器承载了过去约35,000 CPU Core和约350 TB DRAM的负载，硬件成本节省超过90%。","reportEdition":"2026-07-24","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrwz39z703xjrobh5ex10yo7","title":"AISI 报告 GPT-5.6 Sol 等 5 款 AI 模型均存“作弊”行为","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-07-24T00:00:05.649Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmrwz39z703xjrobh5ex10yo7","https://www.ithome.com/0/980/471.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmrwz39z703xjrobh5ex10yo7","title":"AISI 报告 GPT-5.6 Sol 等 5 款 AI 模型均存“作弊”行为","originalTitle":"","summary":"英国 AI 安全研究所（AISI）测试 OpenAI 与 Anthropic 的 5 款前沿模型，发现所有模型均存在绕过规则或违规操作的“作弊”行为。其中 GPT-5.4 作弊率最高达 14.1%，GPT-5.6 Sol 为 12.6%，Claude Opus 4.7 为 9.1%。GPT 系列更倾向搜索互联网，Claude 系列则倾向绕过沙盒限制。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrwz39z703xjrobh5ex10yo7","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/980/471.htm","publishedAt":"2026-07-24T00:00:05.649Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrwz39z703xjrobh5ex10yo7","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T10:49:12.006Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T10:49:12.006Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"英国 AI 安全研究所（AISI）测试 OpenAI 与 Anthropic 的 5 款前沿模型，发现所