认指控，但法律专家指出 Apple 是出了名的缠讼者，此前曾通过版权和专利诉讼分别对抗 Microsoft 与 Samsung。","reportEdition":"2026-07-24","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrxfjpf800tero983dojzltm","title":"昆仑万维方汉：Token堆不出AI原生组织，模型才是长期立足之本","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-07-24T00:00:05.649Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmrxfjpf800tero983dojzltm","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TEAuv29LPgmjQG_rO3b_Ag"],"articles":[{"id":"cmrxfjpf800tero983dojzltm","title":"昆仑万维方汉：Token堆不出AI原生组织，模型才是长期立足之本","originalTitle":"","summary":"昆仑万维CEO方汉在WAIC圆桌上指出，单纯堆砌Token消耗量无法衡量AI价值，模型能力需依赖Claude Code等Coding Agent建立的工程框架才能转化为生产力。他透露昆仑万维仍在持续训练模型，并将发布音乐、具身世界和游戏世界模型，认为模型与算力是AI公司长期立足的基础。方汉同时警示，AI编程带来的技术债可能导致生产事故增幅达数倍，代码审查与责任机制必须同步加强。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrxfjpf800tero983dojzltm","originalUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TEAuv29LPgmjQG_rO3b_Ag","publishedAt":"2026-07-24T00:00:05.649Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-wep3x4","originalSourceName":"公众号：昆仑万维（天工）","family":"outlet-n4ct4m","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrxfjpf800tero983dojzltm","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T10:49:12.006Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-wep3x4","name":"公众号：昆仑万维（天工）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T10:49:12.006Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"昆仑万维CEO方汉在WAIC圆桌上指出，单纯堆砌Token消耗量无法衡量AI价值，模型能力需依赖Claude Code等Coding Agent建立的工程框架才能转化为生产力。他透露昆仑万维仍在持续训练模型，并将发布音乐、具身世界和游戏世界模型，认为模型与算力是AI公司长期立足的基础。方汉同时警示，AI编程带来的技术债可能导